This product is inspired by and references Ragent:

    https://github.com/nageoffer/ragent

Ragent is an enterprise Agentic RAG project. my-agent keeps the RAG / Agent /
MCP engineering baseline learned from Ragent, and extends it toward enterprise
workflow execution, confirmation-gated writes, platform RBAC, reasoning-trace
audit, and an isolated ERP integration boundary.

Please respect Ragent's own license when reading or reusing that project.
